{"id": "DcyjrwJPCdw", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLAUDE\" to get Free AI Courses at Claude Academy.\n\nAnthropic just launched Claude Academy.\n\nIt's their new free learning platform to help you master Claude for completely free.\n\nInside, you get access to full courses on Claude Code, Cowork, Projects, and the Claude API.\n\nYou also learn how to use it to build anything you want.\n\nIf you're a total beginner, this is the best place to start.\n\nThe courses walk you through everything from your very first prompt to your first real project.\n\nIf you already know the basics, there's more for you too.\n\nThey also have full nine hour developer programs on MCP, agents, tool use, and much more.\n\nThese are built for people who want to go deep, not just skim the surface.\n\nAnd it's not just videos.\n\nEvery course comes with quizzes, lectures, notes, and real examples of how to actually use this stuff at work.\n\nSo you're not just watching, you're actually testing what you learned as you go.\n\nPlus once you finish a course, you also get an official completion badge.\n\nYou can put it straight on your LinkedIn or your resume.\n\nIt's a simple way to show employers or clients that you actually know how to use these tools.\n\n#claudeai #claudeacademy #claudecourses #aicourses #Anthropicai ", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1788362923, "like_count": 1965, "comment_count": 1993, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2884764121901644a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.652, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNyNTGGDXzks92XLtsvhMizfVOVMXZFsX-sWoJGqPqnxt9hPmxsdMY9FYkL6t4gjamCdrqnuRRkuYjiCOIhF0chICUhv7qxvHbycWI.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdoTlkPRo70dMdbcFKKIIuRmvceHWUhOuqqI2r5TCJ08LBHlt32WuSwirUPRJoGKh